Third-party data
----------------
Some projects include small slices of public datasets as test fixtures or
samples. These files are NOT covered by the Apache License; they remain under
their providers' terms. Changes such as filtering, slicing, unit or time-zone
conversion are documented next to each file (manifest.json or README).

- Bundesnetzagentur, Ladesäulenregister (public EV charging station register)
  Data-engineering/reference-warehouse/fixtures/bnetza_hesse_slice.csv
  Licence: CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Source: Bundesnetzagentur

- Bundesnetzagentur | SMARD.de market data (wholesale prices, actual total load)
  Data-engineering/reference-warehouse/fixtures/smard_prices_slice.csv
    (retrieved via the Fraunhofer ISE energy-charts API)
  gcp/01-european-energy-pipeline/src/energy_pipeline/data/*.csv
  Licence: CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Source: Bundesnetzagentur | SMARD.de

- European Central Bank, ECB Data Portal (euro reference exchange rates,
  key interest rates)
  Data-engineering/reference-warehouse/fixtures/ecb_fx_slice.csv
  databricks/01-ecb-delta-lakehouse/fixtures/ecb_*.csv
  Terms: ECB Data Portal terms of use; source: European Central Bank

- OpenSky Network (ADS-B state vectors)
  Raw OpenSky data is not stored in this repository. Summary statistics and
  evidence files in Fraport-adsb-intelligence/ are derived from OpenSky data
  and remain subject to the OpenSky Network terms of use; they are not
  relicensed under the Apache License.

Other fixtures (for example in Devops-engineering/ and Mlops-engineering/)
are synthetic.

